  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>175 fotos de la presentaci&oacute; la nit d&#39;aquest divendres d&#39;Ivette Piquer Carrasco com a reina de les festes al barri de Sant Joaquim, a Onda, on pren el relleu d&#39;Irune Mata Pitarch.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/IMG_4145.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ha presentat l&#39;acte Ram&oacute;n Cabedo Esteve i ha fet de mantenidor Pedro Herrera Esteve.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/IMG_4263.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La vetlada ha acabat amb l&#39;actuaci&oacute; del grup De Calle.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinasantjoaquim17/img_4069.jpg\" alt=\"img_4069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinasantjoaquim17/img_4070.jpg\" alt=\"img_4070\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinasantjoaquim17/img_4071.jpg\" alt=\"img_4071\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinasantjoaquim17/img_4072.jpg\" alt=\"img_4072\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinasantjoaquim17/img_4073.jpg\" alt=\"img_4073\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinasantjoaquim17/img_4076.jpg\" alt=\"img_4076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinasantjoaquim17/img_4077.jpg\" alt=\"img_4077\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinasantjoaquim17/img_4079.jpg\" a